          "id": "https://catalog.opengrid.org/field/pypsa-eur-weather-cutouts/influx_direct",
          "inferenceBasis": "Resolved by alt-label similarity at 0.84. atlite's influx_direct is horizontal direct irradiance, whereas the concept is direct NORMAL irradiance; the two differ by the cosine of the solar zenith angle. Recorded as inferred rather than confirmed so a consumer sees the caveat.",
          "inferredAssignment": true,
          "label": "Direct solar influx",
